{
  "order": 0,
  "title": "Age of Silence",
  "name": "The Last Stone",
  "color": "#9AA3AD",
  "icon": "minecraft:cobblestone",
  "lore": [
    "Before there was ground, there was the Weaver, and the Weaver had a Loom. On it she wove the world thread by thread: stone from grey thread, rivers from blue, every living thing from red.",
    "The Unraveler was born from the loose ends, every frayed thread she ever cut away. He was hollow and hungry, and he learned that pulling a thread makes the world forget. So he pulled, until there was nothing left but the Void.",
    "One knot held: the Heartstone, buried deep inside the Last Stone. With the last of her strength the Weaver tied two souls together with her final Red Thread and wove them in beside it. 'Remember the world for me.'",
    "You wake in the dark, side by side. The Heartstone glows. When you strike the block on top of it, it remembers."
  ],
  "weaver": "Break the block on the Heartstone. It will remember.",
